# PromoRush Flash Sale Environment Variables

# Backend Golang API Base URL (adhering to docs/api-contract-v1.md)
# Example local: http://localhost:8080
# Example staging/prod: https://api.promorush.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8080

# In-App DevTools Widget (set to 'true' in Vercel to inspect network & server actions)
NEXT_DEVTOOLS_ENABLED=false

